@startuml
' UML Component 01 — Suar modular monolith boundaries
' Evidence status: Implemented source structure; this diagram does not claim independently deployed services.
' Updated: 2026-07-27.
' Scope: application pipeline and logical source boundaries, not every module/file.

!pragma layout elk
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam PageMargin 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #64748B
  FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "Suar application process\n<<modular monolith>>" as Suar {
  component "HTTP & Presentation delivery\nroutes · middleware · controllers · mappers" as Http
  component "CQRS Application Core\nactions/commands · actions/queries · actions/ports\nidentity · delivery · marketplace · review · capability" as ApplicationCore
  component "Outer Composition & Boundary Guards\napp/composition adapters · exception boundaries" as Composition
  component "Platform Support & Realtime\naccountability · Transmit SSE gateway · search shell" as PlatformSupport
  component "Infrastructure Adapters\ninfra/repositories/read|write · Lucid · Redis · ES adapters" as Adapters
}

node "Runtime data services\nPostgreSQL · Redis · Elasticsearch (dev:9200 / test:9201)" as RuntimeData

Clients --> Http : HTTP / Inertia (user, org, admin)
Http --> ApplicationCore : inbound action ports
ApplicationCore --> Composition : consumer outbound ports
Composition --> Adapters : binds ports to adapters
ApplicationCore ..> PlatformSupport : realtime push + audit events
Adapters --> RuntimeData : persists · caches · queries (guarded)

@enduml
